---
title: "The relay"
note: "A thing travels through a city from hand to hand, for ever. Every clip, the one who carries it ($holder~1) hands it to a stranger ($holder, from __characters/average_joes__) somewhere new. After four handoffs it either rests for a moment, or (one time in four) slips and is chased across the street until someone catches it; then the relay goes on. GOTO lines steer it; the things and places come with the preset (@lib). Run (Instant) plays it until you stop."
tags: [loops, h3, reel, goto, motion_context]
---
@h3 t2va 16:9
context: 22
style: live-action, warm city documentary, handheld, one continuous take
$thing = __relay_things__
MUSIC: a light, rolling piano at a walking tempo

@lib relay_things
  a small brass key on a red ribbon
  a glowing paper lantern
  a sealed blue envelope
  a potted lemon tree
  a battered red umbrella
@lib relay_places
  a crowded tram stop
  a flower market under striped awnings
  a bridge over a slow green river
  a narrow stairway between old houses
  the doorway of a busy bakery
  a rooftop garden above the traffic
  a laundromat late at night

CHUNK the start
$holder = __characters/average_joes__
$place = __relay_places__
SHOT 6s: tracking, slow
At $place, $holder finds $thing waiting on a bench, as if it had been left for them, picks it up and sets off at a brisk walk.
SFX: the city murmuring; quick footsteps
HANDOFF: the one carrying it hurries around a corner

CHUNK the handoff repeat 4
$holder = __characters/average_joes__
$place = __relay_places__
$slip = {25% slips}
SHOT 6s: tracking
At $place, $holder~1 arrives out of breath with $thing and presses it into the hands of $holder, who nods once and sets off the other way.
SFX: footsteps meeting and parting; the city around them
HANDOFF: the new carrier hurries off with it
? $slip[slips]: GOTO: the scramble
GOTO: the pause

CHUNK the pause
$holder = $holder~1
$place = __relay_places__
SHOT 6s: static
At $place, $holder sits down for a moment with $thing on their lap, catches their breath and looks at it as if wondering where it is going; then they stand and walk on.
SFX: a quiet moment in the city; a bird; a long breath out
HANDOFF: the carrier walks on with it
GOTO: the handoff

CHUNK the scramble
$holder = __characters/average_joes__
$place = __relay_places__
SHOT 6s: tracking, fast
At $place, $thing slips out of the carrier's hands and tumbles away across the ground; passers-by dodge and lunge for it until $holder snatches it up just in time and walks on, grinning.
SFX: a clatter; a gasp from the crowd; scattered laughter
HANDOFF: the new carrier walks on, holding it tight
GOTO: the handoff
